## Key Configuration Notes

### Backend Configuration (to be set in App Service)
```
Environment Variables:
- CORS_ORIGINS=https://ed-risk-frontend.azurewebsites.net
- GENAI_ENABLED=false
- PYTHONPATH=/home/site/wwwroot
- WEBSITE_USE_DIAGNOSTIC_LOGGING=true

Startup Command:
gunicorn main:app --workers 4 --worker-class uvicorn.workers.UvicornWorker --bind 0.0.0.0:8000
```

### Frontend Configuration (to be set in App Service)
```
Environment Variables:
- VITE_API_URL=https://ed-risk-backend.azurewebsites.net
- NODE_ENV=production
- NODE_VERSION=20.11.1

Build Command: npm run build
Start Command: npm run preview
```

---

## Resource Planning

### App Service Plans
| Resource | SKU | vCPU | Memory | Est. Cost (monthly) |
|----------|-----|------|--------|-------------------|
| ed-risk-backend | S1 | 1 | 1.75 GB | ~$73 |
| ed-risk-frontend | S1 | 1 | 1.75 GB | ~$73 |
| (Optional Upgrade) | S2 | 2 | 3.5 GB | ~$146 each |

### Supporting Services
| Resource | Type | Purpose | Cost |
|----------|------|---------|------|
| Application Insights | Monitoring | Performance & error tracking | Included in S1+ SKU quota |
| Log Analytics | Logging | Centralized logs | ~$30-50/month (1GB/day) |
| Key Vault | Secrets | Configuration storage | ~$0.6/month + operations |

